<LanguageData>
  <!--EN: Based on genetic data retrofitted from Gauranlen Inc.’s investment into dendrology following the Fall of Sorne, phytokins are plant-based humanoids with an emphasis on symmetry and symbiosis. Their ability to subsist only on sunlight and affinity with any and all plantlife make them especially suited to aiding newly established colonies or underperforming industrial farms.\n\nBased on research from the forest planet of Phytok that committed to extensive analysis on human-compatibility with psychic energy, phytokin xenogerms are typically exclusive to high-ranking, supporting roles in megacorporations and planetary governments. Their unique way of reproduction has resulted in many identical offspring, with each generation becoming successively more competent than their progenitor, further contributing to their extremely low numbers. Their affinity with plantlife, along with the side effect of extremely high and ever-increasing psychic sensitivity, mean that any phytokin xenohumans found on the Rim are always adapted to high-concept, dominant trees that are present on their residing planet.\n\nThis particular xenogerm has adapted itself to Gauranlen trees, allowing them to act as a non-stationary Dryad Queen, albeit without potential for growth. They can also improve attempts at connecting with a local Gauranlen tree as well as being twice as effective as a non-phytokin at pruning their own tree.-->
  <VRE_Gauranlenkin.description>根据索恩陷落后 Gauranlen Inc. 对树木学的投资改造的遗传数据，植物素是基于植物的类人生物，强调对称性和共生性。它们仅依靠阳光生存的能力以及与任何和所有植物的亲和力使它们特别适合帮助新建立的殖民地或表现不佳的工业化农场。

基于来自森林星球 Phytok 的研究，该研究致力于对人类与精神能量的兼容性进行广泛分析，植物蛋白异种植物通常只属于大型企业和行星政府中的高级支持角色。它们独特的繁殖方式产生了许多相同的后代，每一代都逐渐比它们的祖先更有能力，进一步导致它们的数量极少。它们与植物的亲和力，以及极高且不断增加的心灵敏感性的副作用，意味着在环缘发现的任何植物素异种人总是适应其居住星球上存在的高概念、优势树木。

这种特殊的异种植物已经适应了Polux树，使其能够发芽新的Polux灌木并提高当地Polux灌木的消耗能力有毒废物。虽然它们对毒性也免疫，但它们已经形成了定期消耗和代谢有毒废物的心理要求。</VRE_Gauranlenkin.description>
  <!--EN: Powerful advisors to rulers and despots, gauranlenkins are beautiful and cunning and possess an ability to connect with a gauranlen tree, greatly enhancing its abilities. Gauranlenkins can spawn two dryads that will consider them their mother, and will obey their every command. They are excellent at taking care of plants and reproduce via planting a saplingchild.-->
  <VRE_Gauranlenkin.descriptionShort>鳉鱼是统治者和暴君的强大顾问，美丽而狡猾，拥有与鳉树连接的能力，大大增强了它的能力。它们对毒性免疫，实际上可以通过消耗和代谢废物来帮助环境。它们非常擅长照顾植物，并通过种植树苗来繁殖。</VRE_Gauranlenkin.descriptionShort>
  <!--EN: gauranlenkin-->
  <VRE_Gauranlenkin.label>波卢克斯金</VRE_Gauranlenkin.label>
</LanguageData>
